message: >-
  If you use ChemistryLab OS in research, teaching material, or another
  publication, please cite it using the metadata below.
title: ChemistryLab OS
type: software
abstract: >-
  An open, declarative platform for interactive chemistry education —
  reactions, molecules, and (planned) lessons and experiments described as
  structured data (ChemSpec) interpreted by reusable engines, rather than
  hardcoded per-reaction application logic.
